  "body": "# Packages\n\n[**Flutter/Dart**](https://pub.dev/packages/sqlite_vector): `flutter pub add sqlite_vector:1.1.2` or `dart pub add sqlite_vector:1.1.2`\n[**Node**](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@sqliteai/sqlite-vector): `npm install @sqliteai/sqlite-vector`\n[**WASM**](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@sqliteai/sqlite-wasm): `npm install @sqliteai/sqlite-wasm`\n[**Android**](https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/ai.sqlite/vector): `ai.sqlite:vector:1.1.2`\n[**Python**](https://pypi.org/project/sqliteai-vector): `pip install sqliteai-vector`\n[**Swift**](https://github.com/sqliteai/sqlite-vector#swift-package): [Installation Guide](https://github.com/sqliteai/sqlite-vector#swift-package)\n\n---\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Benchmark: pivot the table around hardware, and stop measuring in memory by @marcobambini in https://github.com/sqliteai/sqlite-vector/pull/58\n* Record the benchmark changes under Unreleased by @marcobambini in https://github.com/sqliteai/sqlite-vector/pull/59\n* chore(license): change for pypi package by @danielebriggi in https://github.com/sqliteai/sqlite-vector/pull/61\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sqliteai/sqlite-vector/compare/1.1.0...1.1.2",
